OL,3,GNEWSACall for cap on private profit for
OL,4,Apublic services
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrivate profits from delivering
OL,7,Fservices such as free school meals and
OL,8,Fsocial care should be capped, according
OL,9,Fto a senior local government figure.
OL,11,FMiddlesbrough's Labour Mayor Chris
OL,12,FCooke said austerity had left public
OL,13,Fservices vulnerable to market forces,
OL,14,Fwith private entities frequently not
OL,15,Fproviding the required quality of
OL,16,Fservices.
OL,18,FHe made the comments during a visit to
OL,19,Fthe North East by Prime Minister Andy
OL,20,FBurnham, who pledged to target
OL,21,Fcorporate profiteering in services such
OL,22,Fas adult and children's social care.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
