OL,3,GNEWSACall for cap on private profit for
OL,4,Apublic services
OL,5,
OL,6,FCooke, who chairs the Special Interest
OL,7,FGroup of Municipal Authorities for
OL,8,Fmetropolitan councils in the Midlands
OL,9,Fand the north of England, said the
OL,10,Fplans did not go "far enough".
